The placeholder scanner (replacer/CharsReplacer), the relational pass and the placeholder API
functions (PlaceholderAPI), the expansion registry (expansion/manager/LocalExpansionManager), and the
local commands (commands/impl/local) are ported from PlaceholderAPI's source at commit 27ec162. The
built-in player and server placeholders are written for this mod after the names of PlaceholderAPI's
eCloud expansions; they are not copies of them.

Modifications for Horizon (https://github.com/horizon-rust/horizon), the Rust port, the trait mod
glue and the tests, are by Plugin-Horizon contributors.

This is an unofficial port. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by the PlaceholderAPI authors.
